{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790960681,"nonce":"6CsFkc82Rt/IoVcvSG/513cJBao=","title":"rpkg pack --js-host drops the package's native libraries","message":"`rpkg pack` writes the archive, then, when `--js-host` is given, reloads it and writes it again with the JS hosts added (src/rpkg_cmd.rs). The rewrite re-adds the Haxe sources, the method table and the wasm component, but no `NativeLib` entry, so a package packed with `--js-host` loses its dylibs. gpu/pack-rpkg.sh passes `--js-host` whenever wasm-pack is installed.","files":null}]}